      "content": "i hear you but i'm just so broke right now and it's literally throbbing so hard i can barely sleep. honestly i've seen people do this on tiktok all the time and they just use heat and a needle and they're fine. if i just do a tiny little prick on the surface so the pus can come out, is there really that much of a difference? like, if i use a brand new needle and lots of alcohol, isn't that safe enough for just a small thing like this?",
